729050515a6de4188790d8f8462c2804f0031b37022b7043","source_layer":"received_biography","column_projection":[{"column":"30L01","pdf_page":30,"half":"左","leaf":"四上","column_from_right":1,"start":18,"end":21,"text":"永明末"},{"column":"30L02","pdf_page":30,"half":"左","leaf":"四上","column_from_right":2,"start":0,"end":21,"text":"世祖欲北伐使毛惠秀畫漢武北伐圖使融掌其事融"},{"column":"30L03","pdf_page":30,"half":"左","leaf":"四上","column_from_right":3,"start":0,"end":8,"text":"好功名因此上疏曰"}]},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong-wyd","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-wangrong-wyd1739"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p008","text":"永明末，世祖欲北伐，使毛惠秀畫《漢武北伐圖》，使融掌其事。融好功名，因此上疏曰：","mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p008:m0011","surface":"毛惠秀","start":11,"end":14,"person_id":"vao_luy_v0w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p008:m0024","surface":"融","start":24,"end":25,"person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong:p008:m0029","surface":"融","start":29,"end":30,"person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"按本傳及官府原句。"}],"text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"revision_id":1492435,"source_layer":"received_biography","first_line":26,"last_line":26,"line_start":2,"line_end":42,"raw_start":1656,"raw_end":1696,"raw_character_offsets":[1656,1657,1658,1659,1660,1661,1662,1663,1664,1665,1666,1667,1668,1669,1670,1671,1672,1673,1674,1675,1676,1677,1678,1679,1680,1681,1682,1683,1684,1685,1686,1687,1688,1689,1690,1691,1692,1693,1694,1695],"projection_sha256":"912a87d0f85736573fedc34cf498b39226211cbdb4ce383781ca33cf75bb59c7","editorial_excerpt_boundary":true},"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-047-wangrong","book_id":"b-nanqishu-047","work_id":"w-nanqishu","source_id":"s-nanqishu-047-wangrong-ws1492435"},{"id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002","text":"永明末，武帝欲北侵，使毛惠秀畫漢武北伐圖，融因此上疏，開張北侵之議。圖成，上置琅邪城射堂壁上，遊幸輒觀焉。九年，芳林園禊宴，使融爲曲水詩序，當時稱之。上以融才辯，使兼主客，接魏使房景高、宋弁。弁見融年少，問：「主客年幾？」融曰：「五十之年，久踰其半。」景高又云：「在北聞主客曲水詩序勝延年，實願一見。」融乃示之。後日，宋弁於瑤池堂謂融曰：「昔觀相如封禪，以知漢武之德，今覽王生詩序，用見齊主之盛。」融曰：「皇家盛明，豈直比蹤漢武，更慚鄙制，無以遠匹相如。」上以魏所送馬不稱，使融問之曰：「秦西冀北，實多駿驥，而魏之良馬，乃駑不若，將旦旦信誓，有時而爽，駉駉之牧，遂不能嗣？」宋弁曰：「當是不習地土。」融曰：「周穆馬跡遍於天下，若騏騮之性，因地而遷，則造父之策，有時而躓。」弁曰：「王主客何爲勤勤於千里？」融曰：「卿國既異其優劣，聊復相訪，若千里斯至，聖上當駕鼓車。」弁曰：「向意既須，必不能駕鼓車也。」融曰：「買死馬之骨，亦以郭隗之故。」弁不能答。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":11,"end":14,"surface":"毛惠秀","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0011","person_id":"vao_luy_v0w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作毛。"},{"start":21,"end":22,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0021","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":63,"end":64,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0063","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":77,"end":78,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0077","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作融。"},{"start":89,"end":92,"surface":"房景高","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0089","person_id":"cua_mzu_j40","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作房。"},{"start":93,"end":95,"surface":"宋弁","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0093","person_id":"sra_l7p_eeg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作宋。"},{"start":96,"end":97,"surface":"弁","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0096","person_id":"sra_l7p_eeg","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作宋。"},{"start":98,"end":99,"surface":"融","id":"c-nanshi-021-wangrong:p002:m0098","person_id":"euq_wt7_i8i","kind":"person","status":"c